pecialization","confidence":"medium","mapping_status":"reviewed_against_local_tree"}],"mapping_gap":null}],"agent_notes":["The 2025 NIRF Engineering and Overall directories both list the exact institution name with Varanasi, Uttar Pradesh.","Normal TLS verification failed with curl error 60 (self signed certificate in certificate chain) for expected public hosts; curl --insecure was used only for public GET requests to the expected iitbhu.ac.in and nirfindia.org hosts after confirming their hostnames.","The official Academic Affairs index exposes 16 department course pages, while the official department directory also exposes Metallurgical Engineering and the NC Jain School of Decision Sciences and Engineering; those direct pages were reviewed separately.","The catalogue remains partial for batch import: the DSE home page states IDD, M.Tech and Ph.D programmes but its current course page exposes only the M.Tech curriculum; several department pages expose generic programme selectors with dated or missing curriculum details. Eligibility and delivery mode are not stated on the reviewed central catalogue pages and are left null/not_stated.","The Mathematics and Humanistic Studies pages were reviewed as course-structure pages; they expose subject-course/foundation structures rather than a named standalone degree programme and were not imported as degree records."]}